        "created_at": "2014-08-11T10:38:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Pinecone3\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pinecone3/48/2494_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pinecone3:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>He did say it wasn't going to be the last we saw of him…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That he did - but we still have a few sets of SotM coming.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  (And the potential of a promo villain with WotC. That's my hope, anyway!  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> )</p>",
        "post_number": 12,
